<h1 style="margin: 0px 0px 17.39px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #fefefe; line-height: 1.3; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-word-wrap: normal; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">E-Mail-Adresse bestätigen</h1>
